            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-sichuan-leshan-zigong-yibin-2025-m2:grammar-fill:5",
            "text": "The movie’s rise reflects a shift in China’s film industry. Once dominated by Hollywood, domestic productions across genres are now surpassing Western films, driven by growing cultural pride, enhanced storytelling, and rapid technological advancements. This trend signals a changing global film landscape."
